direct: w=5/16; H M L signal failure = 1/2 1/4 1/8 5/128 11/128
intact return: w=1; H M L signal failure = 1/2 1/4 1/8 1/8 0
unread herald return: w=73/128; H M L signal failure = 1/2 1/4 1/8 73/1024 55/1024
