Finite contrast (2^q-2)^2/Z; every signed-infinite zero has H=0.
Ordinary outer routing plus inner maximum makes w=73/128 appear perfect. Inner q=0 with weight 4015/8192 and q=2 otherwise gives the ordinary dephased table.
